1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:06,300
The quickest way to trade: click a price in the watchlist.

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:10,660
Clicking the Ask opens a Buy. Clicking the Bid opens a Sell.

3
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:17,190
Click Buy to place it.

4
00:00:17,290 --> 00:00:21,000
To hedge a trade, click the H next to it.

5
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:25,360
The ticket is set up for you: the opposite side, the same amount.

6
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:29,220
The comment links it to the trade it protects.

7
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:35,550
Click Sell to open the hedge.

8
00:00:35,650 --> 00:00:40,050
Now you hold a Buy and a Sell of the same size, so the price no longer moves your profit.

